MTT Fountain was added in '''Beta 7.6''', alongside 13 others.

Originally, MTT Fountain was shown [https://twitter.com/undercardsgame/status/833699576213340162 here], on Undercards's Twitter Page. There, it didn't have the Taunt it gained when it was added to the game.

'''Beta 8.1''' reworked MTT Fountain so they work the same as cards like [http://undercards.wikia.com/wiki/Gaster Gaster] and [http://undercards.wikia.com/wiki/Memorial_Statue Memorial Statue] at that time: Giving it 1 ATK, but also the ''<u>Can't attack</u>'' Ability. '''Beta 10.1''' increased its cost to 5G. And '''Beta 13.1''' lowered its HP from 8 to 6. '''Beta 19.0''' lowered its HP further to 5.
